# PERF-005 Phase 5: THE NEW BASELINE. baseline.sets's two sets (baseline
# and baseline_oracle, every value named as there) on the tree with the
# Phase 3 changes in it (R1 ftq_ftb_sched; R2 sc_cntrl; R4 tage_cntrl; R5
# sc.sv; R6 bp_history + bp_cluster; R7 bp_cluster p2 + p3; not R3) and
# the harness with the Phase 1-3 probes and checks: perf/build/tree_s2,
# built from the repo tree (NAME=tree make -C perf harness), NUM_PRED_SLOTS
# 2, the PF-5 configuration. Over perf/studies/baseline.traces (105).
baseline        bin=perf/build/tree_s2/perf_fe --decode-lat fixed:0 --rename-lat fixed:0 --dispatch-lat fixed:0 --execute-lat fixed:0 --resolve-commit fixed:0 --take-rate fixed:8 --window 0 --icache real --mispredict-rule fetch
baseline_oracle bin=perf/build/tree_s2/perf_fe --decode-lat fixed:0 --rename-lat fixed:0 --dispatch-lat fixed:0 --execute-lat fixed:0 --resolve-commit fixed:0 --take-rate fixed:8 --window 0 --icache real --mispredict-rule fetch --oracle
